-->delay() vs Thread.sleep()

| Feature         | delay()                    | Thread.sleep()                 |
| --------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Type            | Suspending function        | Blocking call                  |
| Used in         | Coroutines                 | Normal threads                 |
| Thread blocking | Does NOT block thread      | Blocks thread                  |
| Performance     | Efficient (non-blocking)   | Inefficient (blocks resources) |
| UI impact       | Safe (won’t freeze UI)     | Can freeze UI                  |
| Import          | kotlinx.coroutines.delay   | java.lang.Thread.sleep         |